\newlabel{fig:curves12}{{7}{14}{YOLOv12s training dynamics, same convention as Fig.~\ref {fig:curves26}. The mAP$_{50\text {-}95}$ panel shows the same signature as YOLO26 --- the loss axis alone ends $-0.37\%$ below the baseline while every configuration containing the architecture ends above it --- which is the one part of the loss mechanism's behaviour that is common to both detectors.\relax }{figure.caption.14}{}}
